      {
        "id": 88354,
        "name": "Ario",
        "username": "Ario",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/{size}/1866_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-21T14:37:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Koga wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Speaking of an environment and villain working together. We noticed the other night that in&nbsp;Mobile Defense Platform, the targets with the \"Minion\" keyword would work with Voss and his minions. And one of Voss's cards reduces damage dealt to Thorathians and Minions.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI really don't think that is the intent. But I see what you mean. Opps\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Actually at Kantcon last year Christopher specifically mentioned the Minion keyword in the MDP by saying that it counts towards Voss's alternate win condition, so it follows that all other minion based effects would work with them as well.&nbsp;</p>",
