        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ario\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/48/1866_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ario:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Actually at Kantcon last year Christopher specifically mentioned the Minion keyword in the MDP by saying that it counts towards Voss's alternate win condition, so it follows that all other minion based effects would work with them as well.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh, well in that case! Yikes that's going to be a very nasty setup then huh?</p>",
